# Plot sources: each panel's source is a picker (click the title), `+ series` overlays another source of the same unit, the
# presets row sets common layouts, panels add/remove/move, and overlaying flights combines with multiple sources.
#   cargo run -q -p bowshock -- drive --example crates/bowshock/scripts/plotsources.drive out/plotsources
viewport 1280x800
click (663, 18)
click "Run"
screenshot 01-default.png

# Click a panel's title: a searchable menu of every source, grouped. Choosing one replaces the panel's source.
click (416, 402)
screenshot 02-picker.png
type "total"
screenshot 03-picker-search.png
click "Total velocity"
screenshot 04-source-changed.png

# `+ series`: only sources with the same unit can join; the others are listed but disabled (hover says why).
click (855, 402)
screenshot 05-add-series-menu.png
type "thrust"
move "Thrust"
move "Thrust"
screenshot 06-disabled-reason.png
click (600, 250)
click (855, 402)
type "wind"
click "Wind speed"
screenshot 07-two-sources.png

# Add a plot: it starts with a source no panel shows yet; the third panel's title picks again.
click "Add plot"
screenshot 08-add-panel.png

# Presets.
click "Aerodynamics"
screenshot 09-preset-aero.png
click "Stability"
screenshot 10-preset-stability.png
click "Forces"
screenshot 11-preset-forces.png

# Compare two flights with two sources each: colour by flight, line style by source.
click "Flight profile"
click "Run all"
click (17, 94)
click (17, 138)
click (767, 421)
screenshot 12-compare-add-menu.png
type "total"
click "Total velocity"
screenshot 13-compare-two-sources.png
move (600, 600)
move (610, 600)
screenshot 14-compare-hover.png

# Light theme.
click "Light"
screenshot 15-compare-light.png
click "Stability"
screenshot 16-stability-light.png
